     "a4fa4215-bc16-4b54-9b29-a705e68e4e99"], Cell[
    "Minkowski space", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "1940d126-7f64-4bec-8113-58d04a7b3f3a"], Cell[
    "Timelike geodesic", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "8539cc44-2e3a-47aa-9b5d-b0684e1826d9"], Cell["\<\
Between two timelike-separated events the straight worldline is the unique \
causal curve of maximal proper time.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"d7359448-82ef-4122-8b10-24897ccb50fe"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "4d484e2b-6c52-4314-a940-d79fed1bca94"], Cell[
    "Causal sets", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "50a47b56-65f2-4830-b3bd-bbe5354fd616"], Cell[
    "Longest chain", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "dff326fe-c31b-40a1-924a-0569cef2b174"], Cell["\<\
The length of a longest chain between two elements of a sprinkling estimates \
the proper time between them.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"494742aa-58c6-48f2-aaa0-4d14bdd47106"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "1bfe569e-b4f5-4e57-82d1-6ac1b767c004"], Cell[
    "EPS", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "42138c20-5cd7-4141-bb45-a514b62baa97"], Cell[
    "Free particle", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "12b92483-0fcd-4c2a-aba2-e9d2774f0e67"], Cell["\<\
The worldlines of freely falling particles are the geodesics of the \
projective structure.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"333861df-7156-4e98-abe5-c89c3b5b5f58"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"bd04f542-e482-40e3-8a68-\
e217638ab5eb"]
}, Open  ]],

