Cell["\<\
The graph of the worldlines on the sprinkling. Every longest chain is a path \
through it from its source to its sink.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"674ffdd8-e60f-4d27-9642-4d79a7dd6cab"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "  ", 
