Cell["\<\
The members are vertex lists. Three of the 20 worldlines from the bottom row \
to the top row of the cylinder lattice, each drawn as a walk.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"c34a12a8-11bf-4e2c-80c2-ef56a0b95ad1"],

